</div>
<section class="licora-updater-card"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px"><div><h2>Preflight & Installation State</h2><p>Installation remains disabled until the signed manifest and every mandatory server check pass.</p></div><span class="vib-badge" id="preflight-summary">Not run</span></div><div class="licora-preflight" id="preflight-results"><div class="licora-inline-info">Run Preflight to verify signature, PHP/extensions, storage, source permissions, disk space, and updater compatibility.</div></div><div id="active-job-panel" <?php echo $active?'':'hidden';?> style="margin-top:12px"><div class="licora-release-line"><span>Active Job</span><strong id="active-job-id"><?php echo updater_e($active['job_uuid']??'');?></strong></div><div class="licora-job-progress"><span id="active-job-progress" style="width:<?php echo (int)($active['progress']??0);?>%"></span></div><div class="licora-job-meta"><span id="active-job-stage"><?php echo updater_e($active['stage']??'');?></span><span id="active-job-percent"><?php echo (int)($active['progress']??0);?>%</span></div></div></section>
